/span>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"use-text\">\n            钩针是钩针编织的必备工具，<br>\n            有多种尺寸与规格，具体如何<br>\n            选择可参考《钩针毛线对照<br>\n            表》、《如何选择钩针和毛<br>\n            线》\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"advice-text\">\n            3mm左右的钩针<br>\n            最实用\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[实物图：多支彩色钩针]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 137\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <defs>\n                <linearGradient id=\"hookBg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n                  <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\"/>\n                  <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#f8f8f8\"/>\n                </linearGradient>\n              </defs>\n              <rect x=\"7\" y=\"45\" width=\"82\" height=\"55\" fill=\"url(#hookBg)\"/>\n              <g stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#f0a91c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <line x1=\"13\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#d743ad\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <line x1=\"17\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#20a8d1\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"77\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#784cc1\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#228fbc\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <path d=\"M73 62 q9 -4 6 -9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f0a91c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M70 57 q9 -4 6 -9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d743ad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M76 51 q8 -4 5 -9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#20a8d1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"row-two\">\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"tool-name\">毛线</div>\n          <span class=\"required\">（必备）</span>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"use-text\">\n            毛线种类很多，新手建议选择<br>\n            股数较少的，可减少失误次<br>\n            数。具体如何选择参考《如何<br>\n            选择钩针和毛线》\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"advice-text\">\n            中粗的宝宝棉/牛<br>\n            奶棉\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[实物图：篮子中的彩色毛线]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 114\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect width=\"96\" height=\"114\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n              <g>\n                <ellipse cx=\"49\" cy=\"68\" rx=\"37\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"#9a633c\"/>\n                <path d=\"M13 67 Q17 94 49 96 Q80 93 85 67 Z\" fill=\"#a66f46\"/>\n                <path d=\"M17 72 Q48 84 81 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#694226\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M20 78 Q49 89 78 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#70472b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M25 85 Q49 93 73 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#734a2d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M18 57 Q49 35 80 57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7a4a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"29\" cy=\"61\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#f4c05a\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"43\" cy=\"57\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#f095aa\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"57\" cy=\"59\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#a5ca73\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"62\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#72b8cf\"/>\n                <g fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\".6\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 60 q9 -8 18 0 q-8 9 -17 1\" stroke=\"#bd8529\"/>\n                  <path d=\"M34 56 q9 -8 18 1 q-8 9 -17 0\" stroke=\"#c65372\"/>\n                  <path d=\"M48 58 q9 -8 18 1 q-8 8 -17 0\" stroke=\"#658d3e\"/>\n                  <path d=\"M62 62 q7 -8 15 0 q-7 7 -14 0\" stroke=\"#3f819a\"/>\n                </g>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"row-three\">\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"tool-name\">剪刀</div>\n          <span class=\"required\">（必备）</span>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"use-text\">剪断编织过程中的编织线</div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"advice-text\">必备</div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[实物图：剪刀]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect width=\"96\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n              <g transform=\"translate(48 40) rotate(-30) translate(-48 -40)\">\n                <path d=\"M47 35 L70 12 L75 14 L54 39 Z\" fill=\"#bec5c5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M51 40 L76 23 L79 27 L56 45 Z\" fill=\"#707979\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"43\" cy=\"46\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222a2b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"57\" cy=\"52\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222a2b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"51\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d8d8d8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"row-four\">\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"tool-name\">缝合针</div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"use-text\">缝合、修补和连接编织面料</div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"advice-text\">非必须</div>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[实物图：彩色缝合针]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 96 66\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect width=\"96\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n              <g stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\">\n                <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#e6453a\"/>\n                <line x1=\"29\" y1=\"61\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"11\" stroke=\"#86b722\"/>\n                <line x1=\"40\" y1=